# Revisions to skip in `git blame`.
#
# Enable locally, once:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub reads this file automatically, so blame in the web UI already skips
# these. Your terminal does not, until you run the line above.
#
# Only ever add commits that change formatting and NOTHING else. A commit listed
# here becomes invisible to blame, so a behaviour change hidden in one would be
# very hard to find later.

